cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PyHealth Federated Learning"
abstract: >-
  Reference framework for federated learning over clinical data, targeting early
  warning of clinical deterioration. Aggregation strategies (FedAvg, FedProx),
  non-IID partitioning, differential privacy and explainability are exposed as
  independent, switchable components.
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
keywords:
  - federated learning
  - healthcare
  - clinical deterioration
  - differential privacy
  - explainability
  - PyHealth
  - Flower
  - PyTorch
